  title: Maze Puzzle
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9517dc5ae319b944aa18c771df4a47b3, type: 3}
  description: '<b>Maze Puzzle</b>


    The objective of a Maze Puzzle is to guide
    the robot through a maze and reach the Goal Tile.


    You must write a program
    that correctly navigates the robot around walls, obstacles, and other hazards
    within the maze.


    Careful planning and proper instruction order are important,
    as incorrect movement may cause the robot to become stuck or take unnecessary
    paths.


    Maze Puzzles are designed to test movement control, sequencing,
    and logical problem solving.'
  isImageBig: 0
